                                "sense_id": "f811003b-fe9a-34d4-99cf-9d3bcd67a4ba",
                                "text": "Einsteinium, the 99th element of the periodic table, was discovered in the fallout of the first hydrogen bomb, detonated by the United States in the Marshall Islands on November 1, 1952."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
